The team completed **150 orders in the first two weeks of sales** and recorded approximately **VND 15 million in revenue over about one month of selling**. The order count and revenue cover different sales periods.

The campaign also recorded **333,000 impressions** and **1,800 website link clicks**. These campaign-delivery totals are reported separately from completed sales. The project received the highest grade in the class.

My contribution covered the survey design and distribution, product and website development, Meta Ads and the post-launch order workflow. The lesson I took forward was to connect a customer finding to a practical decision, then improve the process while the business was actually running.
